        "content": "<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Data</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Real</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Basic</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">--defining mass, postion, and momentum structue</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">freeparticle</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"n\">position</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℝ</span>\n<span class=\"n\">momentum</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℝ</span>\n<span class=\"n\">mass</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℝ</span>\n<span class=\"n\">mass_pos</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mass</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">namespace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">freeparticle</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">noncomputable</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">velocity</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">freeparticle</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℝ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">momentum</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mass</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">noncomputable</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">kinetic_energy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">freeparticle</span><span class=\"o\">):</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℝ</span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">momentum</span><span class=\"bp\">^</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mass</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">noncomputable</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">evo</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">freeparticle</span><span class=\"o\">)(</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℝ</span><span class=\"o\">):</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">freeparticle</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"n\">position</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">position</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">velocity</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"n\">t</span>\n<span class=\"n\">momentum</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">momentum</span>\n<span class=\"n\">mass</span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mass</span>\n<span class=\"n\">mass_pos</span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mass_pos</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">conservation_of_momentum</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">freeparticle</span><span class=\"o\">)(</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">ℝ</span><span class=\"o\">):</span>\n<span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">evo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">momentum</span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">momentum</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">evo</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">uniform_motion</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">freeparticle</span><span class=\"o\">)(</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">ℝ</span><span class=\"o\">):</span>\n<span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">evo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">position</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">position</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">velocity</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">evo</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">energy_conservation</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">freeparticle</span><span class=\"o\">)(</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">ℝ</span><span class=\"o\">):</span>\n<span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">evo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">kinetic_energy</span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">kinetic_energy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">evo</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"n\">kinetic_energy</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>so I tried a toy project, I tried to formalize free particle, how does this look?</p>",
