    {
        "content": "<p>In general making PRs in small steps is a good idea, so I'd say go ahead!</p>\n<p>(but as I mentioned above, I think this belongs in Time.derivative, so you might want to experiment a bit more first. Also, I think having <code>(ContDiff ℝ 2 q)</code> is more idiomatic in this case, I believe chracterising <code>q</code> makes more sense than characterising <code>deriv q</code>)</p>",
